name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how our 4-step process delivers rigorous financial models in 24-48 hours.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vaelo.co.in\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Vaelo\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.3iysonzhh3pit.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon?a0d61ffc213ad2ca\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><noscript><style>\n            /* Fallback for users with JS disabled: override framer-motion initial opacity: 0 */\n            div, span, p, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, section, article {\n              opacity: 1 !important;\n              transform: none !important;\n            }\n          </style></noscript><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col font-sans bg-paper text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"border-b border-ledger-line bg-paper sticky top-0 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between h-16 items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a class=\"flex items-center hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Vaelo\" width=\"120\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-logo-lockup.svg\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-sm text-paper bg-corporate-blue hover:bg-corporate-blue/90 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-sm transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center\"><button class=\"text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue focus:outline-none p-2\" aria-label=\"Toggle mobile menu\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><div class=\"flex-grow\"><div style=\"opacity:0\"><main><section class=\"bg-paper py-24 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-16 border-b border-ledger-line pb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-serif text-ink tracking-tight mb-4\">How Vaelo works</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-slate leading-relaxed\">A closer look at our process—designed to support your professional judgment, not replace it.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-16\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"relative pl-8 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-8 items-start\"><div class=\"hidden md:block col-span-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm\">01</div></div><div class=\"col-span-3\"><div class=\"md:hidden w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm mb-4\">01</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-ink mb-4\">Data Submission &amp; Ingestion</h2><p class=\"text-slate text-lg leading-relaxed\">A rigorous valuation starts with clean data. We accept direct exports from Tally and Zoho Books, or you can submit standard manual P&amp;L and Balance Sheet data via our structured Excel templates. You provide the historical financials; we handle the structuring.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-8 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-8 items-start\"><div class=\"hidden md:block col-span-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm\">02</div></div><div class=\"col-span-3\"><div class=\"md:hidden w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm mb-4\">02</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-ink mb-4\">Deterministic Financial Modeling</h2><p class=\"text-slate text-lg leading-relaxed\">Vaelo does not use generative AI to guess numbers. Every model—whether a Discounted Cash Flow (DCF) valuation, a sensitivity grid, or accretion/dilution logic for deal feasibility—is strictly formula-driven, deterministic, and entirely auditable. We apply Wall Street-standard methodologies that hold up under scrutiny.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-8 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-8 items-start\"><div class=\"hidden md:block col-span-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm\">03</div></div><div class=\"col-span-3\"><div class=\"md:hidden w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm mb-4\">03</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-ink mb-4\">Rapid Turnaround &amp; Delivery</h2><p class=\"text-slate text-lg leading-relaxed\">Time kills deals. You can expect the first draft of the client-ready report within 24 to 48 hours. The final output is delivered securely via WhatsApp or email directly to you, so you never have to log into yet another dashboard to retrieve your work.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-8 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-8 items-start\"><div class=\"hidden md:block col-span-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm\">04</div></div><div class=\"col-span-3\"><div class=\"md:hidden w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm mb-4\">04</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-ink mb-4\">Presentation &amp; Iterative Refinement</h2><p class=\"text-slate text-lg leading-relaxed\">The report is white-labeled with your practice&#x27;s branding—it is your advice, powered by our modeling. If you or your client want to see how a 2% change in terminal growth or a different WACC affects the final value, simply request an adjustment. We regenerate the updated model immediately.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-24 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-ink mb-12 border-b border-ledger-line pb-6\">Common Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-10\"><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 hover:bg-paper transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Is my client&#x27;s data safe?</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-base leading-relaxed\">Absolutely. Data privacy is our highest priority. Our infrastructure is fully encrypted (at rest and in transit) and built to be DPDP Act-conscious. Client data is strictly isolated per CA account, and we never use your clients&#x27; financials to train public or shared models.</p></div><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 hover:bg-paper transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">What if I don&#x27;t use Tally or Zoho?</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-base leading-relaxed\">Not a problem. While direct exports from Tally and Zoho are faster, you can submit standard manual P&amp;L and Balance Sheet data using our structured Excel templates. We accommodate the reality of how your clients maintain their books.</p></div><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 hover:bg-paper transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Can I adjust the assumptions?</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-base leading-relaxed\">Yes. Your professional judgment is paramount. If you disagree with a baseline growth rate, discount rate, or sector multiple based on your knowledge of the client, simply provide the adjusted assumption. We will regenerate the entire model to reflect your exact inputs.</p></div><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 hover:bg-paper transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">How is this different from an online valuation calculator?</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-base leading-relaxed\">Online calculators are generic, self-serve tools that lack depth and rigor. Vaelo provides institutional-grade modeling built specifically around the CA&#x27;s workflow. We produce comprehensive, branded reports (including complex sensitivity analyses) designed to be presented as professional advisory work, not a quick web estimate.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-corporate-blue text-paper py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif mb-6\">Ready to elevate your advisory practice?</h2><p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Request a sample report today to see the rigor of our analysis firsthand. First-time practices can commission their first client report at a discounted pilot rate.</p><a class=\"inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-sm text-corporate-blue bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Request a sample report</a><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-mono text-blue-200\">No subscription required. Pay per report.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div></div><footer class=\"bg-ink text-paper border-t border-ledger-line/20 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"bg-paper p-1.5 rounded-sm shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105\"><img alt=\"Vaelo Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-7 h-7\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-icon.svg\"/></div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-90\">Vaelo</span></a><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Institutional-grade financial analysis, purpose-built for independent Chartered Accountants in India.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How It Works</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono\">Legal</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of Service</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-700/50 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Vaelo. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-4 md:mt-0 font-mono\">Encrypted &amp; DPDP Act Conscious</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n3:I[84834,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"Nav\\\"]\\n4:I[7562,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"PageTransition\\\"]\\n5:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[63935,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"RevealGroup\\\"]\\n9:I[63935,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"RevealItem\\\"]\\na:I[85437,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n12:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4194vy8pwc8fi.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/115e7a2565b70400-s.p.1vgtwd90zpq_8.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.3t6q91iet4nsy.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"f